     1024   END.
     1025   define variable vss-include-info14 as character format "X(65)" no-undo initial "@(#)$Workfile$ $Revision$".
     1026   on F1 of frame fr-D-reason-0 anywhere do:
     1027     if b-help :sensitive then DO: apply "CHOOSE":U to b-help in frame fr-D-reason-0. END.
     1028     return no-apply.
