     1057   on window-close of frame fr-D-reason-0 do: apply "END-ERROR":U to self. end.
     1058   define variable vss-include-info20 as character format "x(65)" no-undo initial "@(#)$Workfile$ $Revision$".
     1059   on help of frame fr-D-reason-0
